 "remarks": "Discover the perfect blend of comfort, convenience, and exceptional location in this desirable first-floor end-unit condominium, ideally situated within walking distance of the Metro-North train station, vibrant town center, and picturesque Mead Park. Filled with abundant natural light from its numerous windows, this inviting five-room residence features two bedrooms, one full bath, and a bright, open-concept living and dining area, ideal for everyday living and entertaining. The finished lower level offers versatile additional living space, while garage parking for one car and two dedicated storage areas provide added convenience. Enjoy the ease of in-town living with charming shops, restaurants, recreational amenities, and commuter transportation just moments away. School bus pick-up and drop off just a few steps away. A wonderful opportunity to enjoy comfortable living in a highly desirable location.",
